  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c17ac5865ce5dc1ae5668c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "All right！没问题！\r\n你也要为我加油喔，please？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1984389891932b45dd85fb04b587c3ff715844f138dbfa373511aedcf7411e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc2a3b0653d5c0ec096e7988",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发寻找能称霸世界的珍珠……\r\n来吧，Let's go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2b6e0c7b61e8f20b127948e9440de81553fe6f3eab17488e2e0f6be8792090",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab44c70753aba086c9129d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来今天也能来一场good的比赛呢♪\r\n呵呵，我要去enjoy啰～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edec1efbc4c5a5764ab512a1252924af22ebe507e522a71d5c830fa9d4aa2778",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a66fa42c528b77d53601d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次表现不能说是best的光芒，\r\n但世界是不等人的。\r\n所以我更得继续前进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca72be38ca4ba1c947f2dc9ea00d7e11888674c9bd8035b4c4f039af6732009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b222e80126c391a7db7d3c49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会亲自证明……\r\n即使是一颗小小的希望\r\n也有能力改变世界……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d7eeb21eb7eb18126a2d293974c6d1fb655df4d67c1debd25bb8a532c4034b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29f4ddaa7a512c39013ec7d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh～I'm so so……\r\n不过，never give up！",
      "source_fingerprint": "665368b1a78e93937f3253c0c96c1ac9b6efe7755c8fa255a8076e85bb31d638",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da88321227cd1968d19b421",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "No problem……\r\n我要化不可能为可能，\r\n这就是我的使命……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2670aebba41ce7f664ea80540ebb70665fc8c8a82b029566b2f7132ba041137f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f07716ef6353d42f889e15a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使面临这种状况，\r\n获胜的可能性也绝非为零。\r\n就此放弃太不像我的作风了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "350853e303004bc95ee5a81ee40835efccf1c9660fc97e383a4e14950bccbeed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36d77cd313c0b2546a549f5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～老实说真是no good……\r\n不过不用担心。如论何时都能\r\n绽放光芒，才像我的作风……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae73d7a4b2599aa430dcac2712fd5cd64f00740c6f95119e1d11a1175f8050e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf1fea8274e1fa96890e9f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a8e24f90cd4cee7b85d86a761229a975aa6276f070c63c399e4666d3e4647c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb2e4145658ca9fcee7c24b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let it go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f45fb902149097552bff695b265d7da93bebdfb1de313e078367b0a43466f29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf2b14ea2d30996e31d89659",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Starting！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a16850fa5dcf90d50071f8744be27ed0658083ebe642694fee7d2e1d3b9cf27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c53e86c82e86261393a1aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Understand～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b12b19dc860d928c8fd913125d383875b2c304decec50d11aacbbd9b06957bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:375f2f2e65e8d3326280a094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oops！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd61bf3fa875016de4da1b2195818d565dbf2f95dc6b06955b4da07cd016bb0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d06197dd3f813f6a451d05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Uh-huh……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f24e14f1656c08ecf30bc348ea4aeae427f35ab77985f44afc226175b4319895",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4632e2115226b713926fc43d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "844513de808fa7c542636951a5ae143c06875d62056fa2f6869a7c04098acb9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a973a2d0a0f96ac3c32c27ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯嗯～海风……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a92edacf18569fef4ede6e816bddeea2a352d916c6a8f59e19eefe2f0022a3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2acbab7ad9ab03244eb64f7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得感谢你呢，Thank you very much！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8555aa4613c3a710739ae818a002891e7bca37e1e8a44a76a3da26bc4a1588d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1cc76c3a0e7cb047a6cac40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一路一同走来的时光……thanks！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df58e1e1f156e8c930b16133b8ed33c0659fccd85164adf83a1be3df322a9ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f71d9d6be9474aa0459c82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟好我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7413b5e186154e087de97292ca8f0ec2e26095cc45d337ca04d0b7d298f7a505",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5802091484b35f3344fd08de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我要上啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3604c1adac25be66b4ba8176bee9bbe87caf466c0729f619139ebf88d882bb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a242a267c430e937c7725c10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Every one！跟我来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1cf4250c38dad5c1191be59ee6d83d19289e614bdffefb480b108a396f97897",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12d52ee5dc4b459e2abe7d83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一路一同走来的时光……thanks！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df58e1e1f156e8c930b16133b8ed33c0659fccd85164adf83a1be3df322a9ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78d1808181a1e916c8cd926b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Active地向前进吧！\r\nGet胜利！And……\r\nTo the world！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7954e14c2e56ea33c2b86b57b4e75990eae7efb2971cb1fbd30243dd56b30a9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9a2552b112b26be7be301d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这颗特大珍珠将绽放光芒，\r\n让全世界！跟你！\r\n都对我着迷不已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6831eb281bd8740e9110f6784463b0e0b2d825a5d03ae29e267c1a20992233b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701565ab5c6de4dd4fb826fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一路一同走来的时光……thanks！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df58e1e1f156e8c930b16133b8ed33c0659fccd85164adf83a1be3df322a9ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6184bd878c7d8b9e10fdd25c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd6cea31bb2ba5a7a34cc6f72aedf60a9538d8f61dd5fddc60e275e5043f039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:406adb81f75d4a75982abd57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只差一步……下次一定会到手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b45cd42994138f06fd1cf850e4be7da7038c62705351cc3fd38cd8aeaaec8cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fbe37de917d3d794599e7f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～so so！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a05aa793fdb1f8aca44beb45f514dffe4816b69c22e651ebd9d7f0d12bd23b4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb092ee22d846c69d25c752e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续！我还要继续往上爬……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7167c48c1b07f8d1a65f845901cceb54d12bf976fa4e7bab7653d5393981d4b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ecfd3b7b2bbdf93ef397a7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "世界、原来这么遥远……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "754a65e963bc9db27c2a2448917dbf91aec7589e0da653dac592ad6ab5bc3cca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b38f56a42f6c343758e482f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看，我这不就证明了吗？\r\n这个世界充满了可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a0b50d370fac93ff3f61be5f7c2fde671d07f702246a7178e760f325a25ff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb08e805f8cc2e7f9b7cd63c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是无限的可能性……啾☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7144b3c176af429f6e1955c011ece2e89c352e53a64aee35ae3ec99fbe0ab6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b2b9ad57f595b5dc06342c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流れ星の軌跡…心に刻めたかしら？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bcd22efc5e405913190a8d924f9b2b7993f9e10a71bf928336209f097e905be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c54687b8a9642e19994b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これが無限の可能性よ…チュッ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "47f68b06b99395af4ae3a29b7f9dc64f6c28195e19e9b3e48c16e0eb98c63633",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e7d98f9d4e36760ccbcc053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's run！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7061e344cd432b3673f0a8acef6701d28a078bc3aa3cac672d5261b537226ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9832d0bf69dd3c07904462fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要向世界展示我的可能性～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "194b1029851c091724c214c15fea84f014867d4d05386d152fc3ba36680059d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:538c46b300a7ad89a954e68e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "音楽とは音と音との重なり合い。\r\nマヤノ！フク！重ねるわよ！\r\nホタテやアコヤの二枚貝のように！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4c55017b79976dd5ff8a05a23c9c0b11d41b65631551b894c4cf8145b2cb163",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58149d29bc59fcde0d63c956",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拓展视野吧！\r\n这样才能亲眼见证\r\n努力的孩子们活跃的表现♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09289ec75abda51e379032c9e2872f5e3faa16a33d2d9459502e86ea4ab2a879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed97dc4020f283d24cc2ead",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想看的是人们追求可能性时\r\n展露的笑容。所以我要展开行动！\r\n因为这才是采珠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2581ccf08d1eeb0dfab2917d0ba45c4410fcb8263fc6ea2752840b189640f619",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdee011b94a58473b8ab0ef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沉睡的珍珠即将觉醒……嗯哼♪\r\n我要让全世界都见识到──\r\n嗯～！Possible！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8443ffa1487bf1341160fbc80b7a2f194f3b28239fe45d8ce94a7fb640b55d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4267b473c00d955b75b2c895",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロッキュー！私たちは\r\nいつだってカムバックするわ！\r\n…笑顔にしたい相手がいる限りね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcc9a58fb25fc74e9504786457f101658f67aa4173d8f3ebbb198202a9d655cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf1f0292eb6f14573652f15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰かとの壁を少し薄くして、\r\n誰かの肩の重みを少し軽くする…\r\n笑いも特別な――魔法なの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e93e8920b3ae0802c572f9a57f041f693094d650fba21794cee0227ca69ac148",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafab7f22a65af447db87df3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファ～ビュラ～ス！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f0b5b9d33356c67e6940a542357e8c573c162700eef7c02f23097a21ec613a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db96140b777dfabf522ada88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星空の旅っ！始めましょうっ！フッフ～！\r\nか・ら・の！ベリーテイスティ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33e622643d5b582137255d1186260d6347be67f3eaddbf29d762a36fe08cdfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70dfd4bfaecb25b8bcbcfce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Yes☆Let's dance！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f9f4fed8450c1fdef41d1631c8b6ab1fb123cf8e827eeb789010a7b94bd7787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
