      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2772ccbd5b0f130f99d2112e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good morning♪\r\n我喜欢一早就展现positive的态度，\r\n这样才能遇见新的可能性！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65315b7553c0293a87658c3d0ddc53b444a77e2eb2e65dbbe85972467f41a566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:452e01a88377846e382aaa64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每天早上必喝味噌汤。\r\n而且要把red味噌跟\r\nwhite味噌……mix起来煮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66e15da5648d3183f40bfbf0bc6aa1b313b17d55c5e82c9a8f463de65eb31665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdbbcf8e333e715c1992f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～～嗯嗯～～～\r\n呼……悠哉宁静的午后\r\n最适合用来想事情了……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d220f4e4a4033383f3e55abd44adcb97acb512f99ed8131a49924f23329beeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c119662e77e877a26c635a02",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此刻夜幕降临于地球的另一边。\r\n而法国正是morning♪……没错！\r\n我就是会行走的世界钟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "272183351839b1b186883d3c622cdcc1e0634e28b18b271ea467be6ffdafe974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7077a03607c111ec758bdb42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你想知道我有没有在黄金时段\r\n入眠……？呵呵，不用担心！\r\n24小时都是我的珍珠时段！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb11164a4bfa80e6084eb86d65e388152c6a1df696349faf64aa91002d8d2c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1042",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3246caba88dfc8accc36f455",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "地球陷入沉睡的此刻令我更想\r\nspark……「飞向世界的冲天炮，\r\n其名为采珠」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c1aacb677b3e4549fd6eb6d4434da6277c610d6cad8a566c19df5d76378602",
